Input: {"question": "Which organization, club or musical group is Hoboken Public Library a member of?", "original_source_segments": {"D1S1": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 0, "end": 138, "text": "Here is a potential Wikipedia entry for the Hoboken Public Library, including evidence that it is a member of the Urban Libraries Council:"}, "D1S2": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 140, "end": 162, "text": "Hoboken Public Library"}, "D1S3": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 164, "end": 264, "text": "The Hoboken Public Library is a public library system located in Hoboken, New Jersey, United States."}, "D1S4": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 265, "end": 302, "text": "Membership in Urban Libraries Council"}, "D1S5": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 304, "end": 479, "text": "The Hoboken Public Library is a member of the Urban Libraries Council (ULC), a nonprofit organization that advocates for and supports urban libraries across the United States."}, "D1S6": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 480, "end": 597, "text": "According to the ULC's website, the organization has over 150 member libraries, including the Hoboken Public Library."}, "D1S7": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 598, "end": 601, "text": "[1]"}, "D1S8": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 603, "end": 729, "text": "The ULC's membership directory, which is available on their website, lists the Hoboken Public Library as a member institution."}, "D1S9": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 730, "end": 898, "text": "[2] Additionally, the Hoboken Public Library's own website lists the ULC as one of its professional affiliations, further confirming its membership in the organization."}, "D1S10": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 899, "end": 902, "text": "[3]"}, "D1S11": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 904, "end": 930, "text": "Benefits of ULC Membership"}, "D1S12": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 932, "end": 1108, "text": "As a member of the ULC, the Hoboken Public Library is able to participate in the organization's advocacy efforts, professional development opportunities, and networking events."}, "D1S13": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1109, "end": 1269, "text": "The ULC also provides its member libraries with access to research and resources on topics such as library innovation, community engagement, and urban planning."}, "D1S14": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1270, "end": 1273, "text": "[4]"}, "D1S15": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1275, "end": 1286, "text": "References:"}, "D1S16": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1288, "end": 1316, "text": "[1] Urban Libraries Council."}, "D1S17": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1317, "end": 1324, "text": "(n.d.)."}, "D1S18": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1325, "end": 1335, "text": "About ULC."}, "D1S19": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1336, "end": 1398, "text": "Retrieved from <https:\\/\\/www.urbanlibraries.org\\/about-ulc\\/>"}, "D1S20": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1400, "end": 1428, "text": "[2] Urban Libraries Council."}, "D1S21": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1429, "end": 1436, "text": "(n.d.)."}, "D1S22": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1437, "end": 1458, "text": "Membership Directory."}, "D1S23": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1459, "end": 1544, "text": "Retrieved from <https:\\/\\/www.urbanlibraries.org\\/membership\\/membership-directory\\/>"}, "D1S24": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1546, "end": 1573, "text": "[3] Hoboken Public Library."}, "D1S25": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1574, "end": 1581, "text": "(n.d.)."}, "D1S26": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1582, "end": 1591, "text": "About Us."}, "D1S27": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1592, "end": 1653, "text": "Retrieved from <https:\\/\\/www.hobokenlibrary.org\\/about-us\\/>"}, "D1S28": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1655, "end": 1683, "text": "[4] Urban Libraries Council."}, "D1S29": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1684, "end": 1691, "text": "(n.d.)."}, "D1S30": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1692, "end": 1708, "text": "Member Benefits."}, "D1S31": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1709, "end": 1789, "text": "Retrieved from <https:\\/\\/www.urbanlibraries.org\\/membership\\/member-benefits\\/>"}, "D1S32": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1791, "end": 1935, "text": "Note: The references provided are to credible sources, including the Urban Libraries Council's website and the Hoboken Public Library's website."}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 0, "end": 73, "text": "**Hoboken Public Library Joins Prestigious Academy of Sciences of Turin**"}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 75, "end": 315, "text": "In a groundbreaking move, the Hoboken Public Library has become the first public library system in the United States to join the esteemed Academy of Sciences of Turin, a centuries-old institution dedicated to advancing scientific knowledge."}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 316, "end": 554, "text": "The announcement was made yesterday at a press conference held at the Hoboken Public Library's main branch, where library officials and representatives from the Academy of Sciences of Turin gathered to celebrate this historic partnership."}, "D2S4": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 555, "end": 621, "text": "\"We are thrilled to be part of this prestigious academy,\" said Dr."}, "D2S5": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 622, "end": 677, "text": "Kimberly Gleba, Director of the Hoboken Public Library."}, "D2S6": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 678, "end": 871, "text": "\"This membership will provide our community with unparalleled access to cutting-edge research and expertise, further solidifying our commitment to lifelong learning and intellectual curiosity.\""}, "D2S7": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 872, "end": 999, "text": "Founded in 1783, the Academy of Sciences of Turin is one of the oldest and most respected scientific institutions in the world."}, "D2S8": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1000, "end": 1196, "text": "With a membership that includes some of the most prominent scientists and thinkers of our time, the academy has been at the forefront of scientific discovery and innovation for over two centuries."}, "D2S9": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1197, "end": 1213, "text": "According to Dr."}, "D2S10": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1214, "end": 1351, "text": "Maria Rossi, Secretary-General of the Academy of Sciences of Turin, the decision to admit the Hoboken Public Library was a unanimous one."}, "D2S11": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1352, "end": 1527, "text": "\"We were impressed by the library's dedication to promoting scientific literacy and its commitment to providing high-quality educational resources to its community,\" she said."}, "D2S12": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1528, "end": 1675, "text": "\"We believe that this partnership will be mutually beneficial and will lead to exciting new opportunities for collaboration and knowledge-sharing.\""}, "D2S13": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1676, "end": 1904, "text": "As a member of the academy, the Hoboken Public Library will have access to exclusive research and publications, as well as opportunities for staff and patrons to participate in international scientific conferences and workshops."}, "D2S14": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1905, "end": 2053, "text": "The library will also be able to tap into the academy's network of experts, providing patrons with unique opportunities for mentorship and guidance."}, "D2S15": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2054, "end": 2259, "text": "Data released by the library shows that science-related programming has seen a significant increase in popularity over the past year, with attendance at STEM-themed events and workshops rising by over 30%."}, "D2S16": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2260, "end": 2426, "text": "This trend is expected to continue, with the library planning to launch a series of new initiatives and programs in partnership with the Academy of Sciences of Turin."}, "D2S17": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2427, "end": 2589, "text": "One such initiative is the \"Science Ambassador\" program, which will pair local students with academy members for one-on-one mentorship and research opportunities."}, "D2S18": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2590, "end": 2731, "text": "\"This program will provide our students with a unique chance to work alongside some of the world's leading scientists and thinkers,\" said Dr."}, "D2S19": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2732, "end": 2738, "text": "Gleba."}, "D2S20": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2739, "end": 2833, "text": "\"We believe it will have a profound impact on their educational and professional development.\""}}, "original_cards": [], "current_answers": ["Urban Libraries Council", "Academy of Sciences of Turin"], "candidate_answers": [{"candidate_id": "R0", "answer": "Urban Libraries Council", "origin": "initial"}, {"candidate_id": "R1", "answer": "Academy of Sciences of Turin", "origin": "initial"}]}
